  "product_info": {
    "title": "Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Business Smartwatch",
    "description": "The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is designed for professionals who value both functionality and style. With advanced health tracking features, it monitors heart rate, body temperature, and key wellness indicators, giving you a well-rounded view of your physical condition. Its 1.39-inch TFT display with 360x360 resolution ensures a crisp and vibrant visual experience – ideal for viewing notifications and smoothly navigating through functions. Built with durable zinc alloy and ABS+PC materials, the smartwatch is made to withstand everyday wear and maintain long-term reliability. Powered by a high-capacity 260mAh battery, it offers 5–7 days of usage and up to 30 days of standby time, with a fast 2-hour charge to keep you going without long downtimes.Equipped with 8+1 sports modes, Bluetooth audio, call and message reminders, and music control, the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is your perfect companion for staying active, connected, and in control — all in one stylish device.",
